  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMS International Media Support 2016 -2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen media sector and access to information. Capacity building and Safety of journalists. IMS works with gender equality and women&apos;s rights in an integrated manner as part of their organisational development and organisational strategy. Gender equality is a cross cutting issue through all six pilars of the agreement in addition to a stand-alone pilar.</narrative>
  </description>
